"""Detect 'box' spellings, with weaker box compounds, Chinese box nouns,
check marks, and related receptacles. A few local boundary rules distinguish
TeX commands, chemical carbox- fragments, and split word endings. Small,
unrelated background activity is deliberately left at zero.
