"""Approximate a local time-word signal, not elapsed time.

'Time' is strongly positive, weaker in operation-latency phrases and stronger
in clock/time-zone phrases. Plural and Chinese, Japanese, Russian and German
time words are weaker. Named growth/failure/transfer rates, process labels,
event dates and completion reports supply opposing signals. Unmatched tokens
receive zero. Remember only a short text tail, resetting between documents.
